// ============================================================================
// test_calcConversionFactor.dos
// Per-function test suite for caplib::calcConversionFactor (fi).
// Signature: caplib::calcConversionFactor(bondCouponRate DOUBLE, bondCpnFreq STRING, nominalCpnRate DOUBLE, bondMaturity DATE, settlementDate DATE, lastCpnDate DATE)
// Uses the native DolphinDB testing framework:
//     test("test/fi")            // whole domain directory
//     python run_tests.py --file fi/test_calcConversionFactor.dos   // single file
// Generated by tools/gen_function_tests - edit metadata/templates, not this file.
